e's functions; running the tests in a page was not measured.\n\nPocket Studio itself: only RayDE's own 28 Oct module boots in headless Chrome (first frame at 785, 857 and 981 ms at load 5-13; one launch at load 37-54 took 20.9 s, unexplained). The builds above could not be booted with RayDE's library modules; see the separate issue.","files":null}]}